Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:04.26,0:00:11.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么现在Y轴和X轴\N互相减去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:12.01,0:00:14.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算出最后的夹角
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:16.41,0:00:18.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太棒了 这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:23.48,0:00:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了 这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:28.15,0:00:31.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干什么啊 突然间好疼啊\N给我听着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:31.76,0:00:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师讲课的时候\N你们就在这里看漫画
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:37.10,0:00:38.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我坐好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:45.10,0:00:49.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干什么啊\N什么干什么 快点把书打开
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:49.64,0:00:53.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干什么啊\N什么干什么 在上课啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:54.85,0:00:56.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 快点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:58.32,0:00:59.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始上课啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我好好记住啊\N要考试的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:12.73,0:01:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的接下来是12页
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:17.94,0:01:26.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个ABC三点4sinx大于0\N求出这个结果
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:28.08,0:01:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 今天到此为止\N辛苦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:33.42,0:01:37.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下个星期\N下星期测试
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.29,0:01:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不合格的人 有可能留级\N大家给我好好学习
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:48.23,0:01:49.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:51.04,0:01:53.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 我在跟你说话啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:55.31,0:01:57.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样?听到了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:58.51,0:02:02.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考试不合格\N就有可能留级
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:05.05,0:02:06.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.79,0:02:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 有马 没事吧\N有马 没事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:15.46,0:02:21.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系的\N我会好好考试的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:22.67,0:02:25.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?什么东西啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:26.81,0:02:30.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个家伙\N我有好办法对付了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:32.28,0:02:37.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事情 什么事情啊\N快点让我看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:40.02,0:02:42.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了不愧是老大啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:46.43,0:02:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女教师的深喉惩罚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:06.18,0:03:08.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了\N谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:09.65,0:03:15.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样?顺利吗?\N这次虽然真的不是很难
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:17.12,0:03:18.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:21.39,0:03:24.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧 这个很难啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:24.46,0:03:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都会留级吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:29.14,0:03:38.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系的 我已经准备好了\N大家以后会更加努力吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:39.81,0:03:41.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:41.81,0:03:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要总是强迫自己\N没事的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:46.75,0:03:49.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都很努力哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:51.69,0:03:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:59.97,0:04:02.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前不是说了\N在学校不要做这个啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:06.24,0:04:08.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正现在也没有人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:13.85,0:04:15.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说了不行啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:44.14,0:04:49.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说了不行啊\N没关系的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:52.29,0:04:53.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人看到的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:05.77,0:05:06.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:52.35,0:05:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样 舒服吧\N好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:20.11,0:06:22.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 不行啊 高潮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:43.92,0:07:47.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 不行 高潮了 高潮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:16.76,0:08:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先回去吧\N我明天测试 今晚留宿吧
