Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:13.01,0:10:14.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:15.54,0:10:22.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 了老师 问一下你问题\N可以吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:23.95,0:10:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:32.23,0:10:33.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个真是糟糕了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:34.36,0:10:37.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我留级是没有问题
